		</div>
	</div> -->

	<div class="relative grid grid-cols-12 w-full md:px-[5%]">
		<div class="animate flex flex-col items-center font-serif col-span-full md:col-span-8 md:col-start-3">
			<div class="text-block resize-animate py-6">
			<h1>support us</h1>
			<p>Thank you for considering supporting Disjunctions. Our magazine is currently run entirely by volunteers, and we are in the process of making it possible to receive donations.</p> 
			<p>We are always on the lookout for people interested in helping us navigate bureaucracy, web dev, social media and design: please reach out if you're interested in any of these.</p>
